"label":"f","task":"$\\frac{10x}{3} - 2 = 18$","expressionAnswer":"6"}],"solution":"a) $x = 0$, b) $x = -4$, c) $x = 2$, d) $x = 10$, e) $x = 28$, f) $x = 6$","hideInlineSolution":true,"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}}]},{"id":"1t-2-1-del2-intro","type":"text","content":"## Grunnleggjande likningar del 2\n### Likningar med brøkar og parentesar\n\nFør du byrjar på del to av grunnleggjande likningar er det viktig at du har brøkrekning ordentleg på plass."},{"id":"1t-2-1-example-7","type":"example","title":"Døme 7","problem":"Løys likningane:\n\na) $\\frac{30}{2x} = 5$\n\nb) $\\frac{3}{x + 2} = 2$","solution":"**Løysing:**\n\na) $\\frac{30}{2x} = 5 \\quad | \\cdot 2x$\n$30 = 10x$\n$10x = 30 \\quad | \\div 10$\n$x = 3$\n\nb) $\\frac{3}{x + 2} = 2 \\quad | \\cdot (x + 2)$\n$\\frac{3(x + 2)}{x + 2} = 2(x + 2)$\n$3 = 2(x + 2)$\n$3 = 2x + 4$\n$2x + 4 = 3 \\quad | - 4$\n$2x = -1 \\quad | \\div 2$\n$x = -\\frac{1}{2}$","solutionVideo":"qU-XL6Rva2U"},{"id":"1t-2-1-ex-block-7","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-2-1-ex-7","number":"7","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Løys likningane","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{6}{x} = 2$","solution":"$x = 3$","expressionAnswer":"3"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{2}{3x} = 2$","solution":"$x = \\frac{1}{3}$","expressionAnswer":"1/3"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{2}{x} - 2 = 7$","solution":"$x = \\frac{2}{9}$","expressionAnswer":"2/9"},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{3}{x + 2} = 1$","solution":"$x = 1$","expressionAnswer":"1"},{"label":"e","task":"$3 = \\frac{-2}{x - 3} + 6$","solution":"$x = \\frac{11}{3}$","expressionAnswer":"11/3"},{"label":"f","task":"$\\frac{2}{2x - 5} = -2$","solution":"$x = 2$","expressionAnswer":"2"}],"solution":"a) $x = 3$, b) $x = \\frac{1}{3}$, c) $x = \\frac{2}{9}$, d) $x = 1$, e) $x = \\frac{11}{3}$, f) $x = 2$","solutionVideo":"k8GDEkTgojM","hints":["Gong begge sidene med nemnaren for å fjerne brøken"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-2-1-example-8","type":"example","title":"Døme 8","problem":"Løys likningane:\n\na) $\\frac{x - 3}{2} = x + 1$\n\nb) $\\frac{3x + 1}{x + 3} = 2$","solution":"**Løysing:**\n\na) $\\frac{x - 3}{2} = x + 1 \\quad | \\cdot 2$\n$x - 3 = 2(x + 1)$\n$x - 3 = 2x + 2 \\quad | + 3$\n$x = 2x + 5 \\quad | - 2x$\n$-x = 5 \\quad | \\cdot (-1)$\n$x = -5$\n\nb) $\\frac{3x + 1}{x + 3} = 2 \\quad | \\cdot (x + 3)$\n$3x + 1 = 2(x + 3)$\n$3x + 1 = 2x + 6 \\quad | - 1$\n$3x = 2x + 5 \\quad | - 2x$\n$x = 5$","solutionVideo":"QRTMT8ZLtk4"},{"id":"1t-2-1-ex-block-8","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-2-1-ex-8","number":"8","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Løys likningane","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{4x - 6}{3} = x + 3$","solution":"$x = 15$","expressionAnswer":"15"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{3x}{x + 1} = 2$","solution":"$x = 2$","expressionAnswer":"2"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{13x + 2}{2x} = 7$","solution":"$x = 2$","expressionAnswer":"2"},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{x + 1}{4} - 15 = -5$","solution":"$x = 39$","expressionAnswer":"39"},{"label":"e","task":"$3 = \\frac{x - 1}{8} + 6$","solution":"$x = -23$","expressionAnswer":"-23"},{"label":"f","task":"$\\frac{3 - x}{x} + 8 = -2$","solution":"$x = -\\frac{1}{3}$","expressionAnswer":"-1/3"}],"solution":"a) $x = 15$, b) $x = 2$, c) $x = 2$, d) $x = 39$, e) $x = -23$, f) $x = -\\frac{1}{3}$","solutionVideo":"WMCO21lyRg4","hints":["Multipliser båe sider med nemnaren, pass på parentesane"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-2-1-example-9","type":"example","title":"Døme 9","problem":"Løys likningane:\n\na) $\\frac{x}{2} + \\frac{2}{3} = 1$\n\nb) $\\frac{2x}{3} - \\frac{2}{5} = 1$","solution":"**Løysing:**\n\na) $\\frac{x}{2} + \\frac{2}{3} = 1 \\quad | - \\frac{2}{3}$\n$\\frac{x}{2} = \\frac{3}{3} - \\frac{2}{3}$\n$\\frac{x}{2} = \\frac{1}{3} \\quad | \\cdot 2$\n$x = \\frac{2}{3}$\n\nb) $\\frac{2x}{3} - \\frac{2}{5} = 1 \\quad | + \\frac{2}{5}$\n$\\frac{2x}{3} = \\frac{5}{5} + \\frac{2}{5}$\n$\\frac{2x}{3} = \\frac{7}{5} \\quad | \\cdot 3$\n$2x = \\frac{21}{5} \\quad | \\div 2$\n$x = \\frac{21}{10}$","solutionVideo":"JF6LBRzXhwE"},{"id":"1t-2-1-ex-block-9","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-2-1-ex-9","number":"9","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Løys likningane","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{x}{4} + \\frac{1}{3} = 1$","solution":"$x = \\frac{8}{3}$","expressionAnswer":"8/3"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{2x}{3} - \\frac{2}{2} = 1$","solution":"$x = 3$","expressionAnswer":"3"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{3x}{2} = \\frac{1}{3}$","solution":"$x = \\frac{2}{9}$","expressionAnswer":"2/9"},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{x}{10} + \\frac{3}{2} = \\frac{1}{5}$","solution":"$x = -13$","expressionAnswer":"-13"},{"label":"e","task":"$\\frac{3x}{2} = \\frac{1}{5} - 2$","solution":"$x = -\\frac{6}{5}$","expressionAnswer":"-6/5"},{"label":"f","task":"$\\frac{1}{4} = \\frac{x}{2} - 3$","solution":"$x = \\frac{13}{2}$","expressionAnswer":"13/2"}],"solution":"a) $x = \\frac{8}{3}$, b) $x = 3$, c) $x = \\frac{2}{9}$, d) $x = -13$, e) $x = -\\frac{6}{5}$, f) $x = \\frac{13}{2}$","solutionVideo":"l4lHWmEgpEw","hints":["Finn fellesnemnar eller multipliser med nemnaren"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-2-1-example-10","type":"example","title":"Døme 10","problem":"Løys likninga:\n\n$\\frac{x}{2} + \\frac{x}{3} = 1$","solution":"**Løysing alternativ 1** (finn fellesnemnar):\n$\\frac{x}{2} + \\frac{x}{3} = 1$\n$\\frac{x \\cdot 3}{2 \\cdot 3} + \\frac{x \\cdot 2}{3 \\cdot 2} = 1$\n$\\frac{3x}{6} + \\frac{2x}{6} = 1$\n$\\frac{3x + 2x}{6} = 1$\n$\\frac{5x}{6} = 1 \\quad | \\cdot 6$\n$5x = 6 \\quad | \\div 5$\n$x = \\frac{6}{5}$\n\n**Løysing alternativ 2** (multipliser med fellesnemnar):\n$\\frac{x}{2} + \\frac{x}{3} = 1 \\quad | \\cdot 6$\n$\\frac{6 \\cdot x}{2} + \\frac{6 \\cdot x}{3} = 1 \\cdot 6$\n$3x + 2x = 6$\n$5x = 6 \\quad | \\div 5$\n$x = \\frac{6}{5}$","solutionVideo":"D8sOJCxWlwU"},{"id":"1t-2-1-ex-block-10","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-2-1-ex-10","number":"10","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Løys likningane","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{x}{4} + \\frac{x}{3} = 1$","solution":"$x = \\frac{12}{7}$","expressionAnswer":"12/7"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{2x}{3} - \\frac{x}{2} = 1$","solution":"$x = 6$","expressionAnswer":"6"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{3x}{2} = \\frac{x}{4}$","solution":"$x = 0$","expressionAnswer":"0"},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{2x}{5} = -\\frac{x}{2} + 10$","solution":"$x = \\frac{100}{9}$","expressionAnswer":"100/9"},{"label":"e","task":"$4 = \\frac{3x}{7} + x$","solution":"$x = \\frac{14}{5}$","expressionAnswer":"14/5"},{"label":"f","task":"$\\frac{x}{2} - \\frac{x}{6} = \\frac{x}{4} - 1$","solution":"$x = -12$","expressionAnswer":"-12"}],"solution":"a) $x = \\frac{12}{7}$, b) $x = 6$, c) $x = 0$, d) $x = \\frac{100}{9}$, e) $x = \\frac{14}{5}$, f) $x = -12$","solutionVideo":"7N0iDdoHO3I","hints":["Gang alle ledda med fellesnemnar for å fjerne brøkane"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-2-1-example-11","type":"example","title":"Døme 11","problem":"Løys likningane:\n\na) $3(x - 2) = 4$\n\nb) $4 - 2(x + 1) = 22$","solution":"**Løysing:**\n\na) $3(x - 2) = 4$\n$3x - 6 = 4 \\quad | + 6$\n$3x = 10 \\quad | \\div 3$\n$x = \\frac{10}{3}$\n\nb) $4 - 2(x + 1) = 22 \\quad | - 4$\n$-2(x + 1) = 18$\n$-2x - 2 = 18 \\quad | + 2$\n$-2x = 20 \\quad | \\div (-2)$\n$x = -10$","solutionVideo":"gPOo3GdR8CU"},{"id":"1t-2-1-ex-block-11","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-2-1-ex-11","number":"11","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Løys likningane","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$2(x - 1) = 4$","solution":"$x = 3$","expressionAnswer":"3"},{"label":"b","task":"$5(x - 2) = 3$","solution":"$x = \\frac{13}{5}$","expressionAnswer":"13/5"},{"label":"c","task":"$2 + 3(x - 1) = 5$","solution":"$x = 2$","expressionAnswer":"2"},{"label":"d","task":"$5(x + 1) = 2(x - 1)$","solution":"$x = -\\frac{7}{3}$","expressionAnswer":"-7/3"},{"label":"e","task":"$6 - 3(x + 2) = x$","solution":"$x = 0$","expressionAnswer":"0"},{"label":"f","task":"$-2(3x - 15) = 8x - (-x)$","solution":"$x = 2$","expressionAnswer":"2"}],"solution":"a) $x = 3$, b) $x = \\frac{13}{5}$, c) $x = 2$, d) $x = -\\frac{7}{3}$, e) $x = 0$, f) $x = 2$","solutionVideo":"hPmz_2nYd5Q","hints":["Multipliser ut parentesane først"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-2-1-example-12","type":"example","title":"Døme 12","problem":"Løys likningane:\n\na) $\\frac{1}{2} - \\frac{2x - 4}{2} = 5$\n\nb) $\\frac{2x}{x + 1} - \\frac{3}{2} = 2$","solution":"**Løysing:**\n\na) $\\frac{1}{2} - \\frac{2x - 4}{2} = 5 \\quad | \\cdot 2$\n$1 - (2x - 4) = 10$\n$1 - 2x + 4 = 10 \\quad | - 1 - 4$\n$-2x = 5 \\quad | \\div (-2)$\n$x = -\\frac{5}{2}$\n\nb) Vi ser at fellesnemnar blir $2(x + 1)$. Gang med dette på begge sider:\n$\\frac{2x}{x + 1} - \\frac{3}{2} = 2$\n$\\frac{2 \\cdot 2x}{2(x + 1)} - \\frac{3(x + 1)}{2(x + 1)} = 2$\n$\\frac{4x - 3(x + 1)}{2(x + 1)} = 2$\n$\\frac{4x - 3x - 3}{2(x + 1)} = 2$\n$\\frac{x - 3}{2x + 2} = 2 \\quad | \\cdot (2x + 2)$\n$x - 3 = 4x + 4 \\quad | - 4x + 3$\n$-3x = 7 \\quad | \\div (-3)$\n$x = -\\frac{7}{3}$","solutionVideo":"Zkg-iMpR-WA"},{"id":"1t-2-1-ex-block-12","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-2-1-ex-12","number":"12","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Løys likningane","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{1}{2} - \\frac{x + 1}{2} = 4$","solution":"$x = -8$","expressionAnswer":"-8"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{1}{3} - \\frac{x - 2}{2} = 2$","solution":"$x = -\\frac{4}{3}$","expressionAnswer":"-4/3"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{x}{x + 2} - \\frac{1}{2} = 1$","solution":"$x = -6$","expressionAnswer":"-6"},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{2x - 1}{x + 5} = -\\frac{3}{2}$","solution":"$x = -\\frac{13}{7}$","expressionAnswer":"-13/7"},{"label":"e","task":"$\\frac{5x - 1}{2x + 1} + \\frac{1}{2} = -\\frac{5}{2}$","solution":"$x = -\\frac{2}{11}$","expressionAnswer":"-2/11"},{"label":"f","task":"$\\frac{5x - 1}{-x + 1} = \\frac{1}{2} - \\frac{5}{3}$","solution":"$x = -\\frac{1}{23}$","expressionAnswer":"-1/23"}],"solution":"a) $x = -8$, b) $x = -\\frac{4}{3}$, c) $x = -6$, d) $x = -\\frac{13}{7}$, e) $x = -\\frac{2}{11}$, f) $x = -\\frac{1}{23}$","solutionVideo":"MbRlTuXfFhc","hints":["Finn fellesnevnar, gang og pass på forteikn i parentesar"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-2-1-example-13","type":"example","title":"Døme 13","problem":"Løys likninga:\n\n$\\frac{3}{4}\\left(\\frac{1}{3} - x\\right) + 2x = 5$","solution":"**Løysing:**\n$\\frac{3}{4}\\left(\\frac{1}{3} - x\\right) + 2x = 5$\n$\\frac{3}{4} \\cdot \\frac{1}{3} - \\frac{3}{4} \\cdot x + 2x = 5$\n$\\frac{1}{4} - \\frac{3x}{4} + 2x = 5 \\quad | \\cdot 4$\n$1 - 3x + 8x = 20 \\quad | - 1$\n$5x = 19 \\quad | \\div 5$\n$x = \\frac{19}{5}$","solutionVideo":"Ykqty_V29EE"},{"id":"1t-2-1-ex-block-13","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-2-1-ex-13","number":"13","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Løys likningane","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{1}{2}(1 - x) = 5$","solution":"$x = -9$","expressionAnswer":"-9"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\frac{x}{3} - 1\\right) = 1$","solution":"$x = 15$","expressionAnswer":"15"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{3}{5}\\left(5 - \\frac{x}{3}\\right) + 2x = 2$","solution":"$x = -\\frac{5}{9}$","expressionAnswer":"-5/9"},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{3}{7}\\left(x - \\frac{1}{2}\\right) = 5 - x$","solution":"$x = \\frac{73}{20}$","expressionAnswer":"73/20"},{"label":"e","task":"$\\frac{5x}{4}\\left(\\frac{1}{3} - \\frac{1}{2}\\right) = \\frac{x}{2} - 1$","solution":"$x = \\frac{24}{17}$","expressionAnswer":"24/17"},{"label":"f","task":"$\\frac{x}{4} - 1 = x\\left(\\frac{1}{3} - 2\\right)$","solution":"$x = \\frac{12}{23}$","expressionAnswer":"12/23"}],"solution":"a) $x = -9$, b) $x = 15$, c) $x = -\\frac{5}{9}$, d) $x = \\frac{73}{20}$, e) $x = \\frac{24}{17}$, f) $x = \\frac{12}{23}$","solutionVideo":"KsXuZEdjbKA","hints":["Multipliser ut parentesane, samla alle x-ledd og konstantar"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-2-1-oppsummering","type":"text","content":"## Oppsummering\n\n- **Løyse likningar:** Gjer same operasjon på begge sider av likheitsteiknet for å isolera $x$\n- **Addisjon/subtraksjon:** $x + a = b \\Rightarrow x = b - a$\n- **Multiplikasjon/divisjon:** $ax = b \\Rightarrow x = \\frac{b}{a}$\n- **Brøklikningar:** $\\frac{x}{a} = b \\Rightarrow x = ab$ (gang begge sider med nemnaren)\n- **Likningar med brøkar:** $\\frac{a}{x} = b \\Rightarrow a = bx \\Rightarrow x = \\frac{a}{b}$\n- **Fleire brøkar:** Finn fellesnevnar og gang heile likninga med denne\n- **Parentesar:** Multipliser ut før du løyser likninga\n- Hugs å kontrollera svaret ved å setja det inn i den opphavlege likninga"}],"exercises":[],"_meta":{"sourceHash":"c13715759b8311d2","translatedAt":"2026-06-16T10:01:26.082Z","model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","strings":301,"tm":{"d4f07f34447f7b20":"Grunnleggjande likningar","627665ee82b43438":"Lær grunnleggjande teknikkar for å løyse fyrstegradslikningar med addisjon, subtraksjon, multiplikasjon og divisjon.","c0e1e50b64a7f983":"løyse lineære likningar","d33c15ab0f4bbf53":"bruke rekneregler for likningar","f298c87fc4bbc400":"## Likningar med addisjon og subtraksjon\n\nFør du startar på dette kapitlet er det viktig at du har pluss og minus (med parentesar) ordentleg på plass.\n\nHovedprinsippet for å løyse likningar er at vi alltid gjer det same på begge sider av likhetstegnet. Når vi skriv $| - 5$ betyr det at vi trekkjer frå 5 på begge sider av likheten.","58916c7752f6e6c9":"Døme 1","1624025a90a4149b":"Løys likningane:\n\na) $x + 5 = 4$\n\nb) $x - 1 = 4$","bdce0b4d4d198740":"**Løysing:**\n\na) $x + 5 = 4 \\quad | - 5$\n$x + 5 - 5 = 4 - 5$\n$x = -1$\n\nb) $x - 1 = 4 \\quad | + 1$\n$x - 1 + 1 = 4 + 1$\n$x = 5$","b0cbe14e4ea900ae":"Løys likningane","93b9a015d13cbffd":"$x + 3 = 5$","0c82bd6cd3ab8ff8":"$x = 2$","aced1fff3a2cb7b8":"$x - 9 = 3$","be6eafd1bba0c385":"$x = 12$","aed7436c9dcb4922":"$x - 20 = 0$","761499b32c8b8212":"$x = 20$","2b0fb1f81e2f41aa":"$x + 200 = -100$","c58d9ab7f97a9028":"$x = -300$","353a74db475cb443":"$x + 22 = 10$","302859de42fd59f3":"$x = -12$","8e2191132d5e6770":"$x + 10 = -2$","326c2e2f6da9e6bc":"a) $x = 2$, b) $x = 12$, c) $x = 20$, d) $x = -300$, e) $x = -12$, f) $x = -12$","6366d651226709e8":"Bruk same operasjon på begge sider av likhetstegnet","ab9b1e0a06de39d5":"## Likningar med variablar på begge sider\n\nFor å forstå denne delen er det viktig å forstå veldig enkel algebra.\n\nDøme på det du må kunne er at:\n- $2x + 3x = 5x$\n- $7x - 6x = x$\n\nVi får heller ikkje lov til å blande konstantar og variablar. $3x + 3 + 2x = 5x + 3$ - vi kan ikkje leggje saman $5x$ og $3$ utan å vita kva $x$ er.","0dcdf90952edec99":"Døme 2","1b7abfa3ad427109":"Løys likningane:\n\na) $4 = x - 2$\n\nb) $2x + 4 = x$","256820148778f485":"**Løysing:**\n\na) $4 = x - 2 \\quad | + 2$\n$6 = x$\n$x = 6$ (Når $6 = x$ så er også $x = 6$)\n\nb) $2x + 4 = x \\quad | - 4$\n$2x = x - 4 \\quad | - x$\n$2x - x = x - 4 - x$\n$x = -4$","1a9922f4cee6b636":"$3 = x - 5$","eae1daf6b9845d7b":"$x = 8$","220b3ea55d49325d":"$4 = x + 3$","b96ae96cb92f7fb0":"$x = 1$","c247b7a22222c370":"$2x - 2 = x$","536ff6ce198769d4":"$3x + 31 = 2x$","e4d1b3a50bc13905":"$x = -31$","c84c24e25a5b5493":"$x + 22 = 2x$","5427cbdf75266c4b":"$x = 22$","dafb8a92e12ea1a8":"$4x + 10 = 3x - 2$","5cce05b79bf13200":"a) $x = 8$, b) $x = 1$, c) $x = 2$, d) $x = -31$, e) $x = 22$, f) $x = -12$","8f6a0526cb8a40af":"Samle x-ledda på éi side og konstantledda på den andre","3212e9b4d593f2ad":"## Likningar med multiplikasjon og divisjon\n\nNår vi har likningar der $x$ er ganget med eit tal, må vi dele begge sider på dette talet for å finne $x$.","24420a2392249d81":"Døme 3","e212932bafc66c23":"Løys likningane:\n\na) $3x = 12$\n\nb) $4x - 3 = 17$","20a573cf3154faf2":"**Løysing:**\n\na) $3x = 12 \\quad | \\div 3$\n$\\frac{3x}{3} = \\frac{12}{3}$\n$x = 4$\n\nb) $4x - 3 = 17 \\quad | + 3$\n$4x = 20 \\quad | \\div 4$\n$x = 5$","e9712bd66172a251":"$5x = 20$","d14d177d812c2ded":"$x = 4$","be22036d541664f1":"$4x = -12$","f68d97e01db3f5aa":"$x = -3$","551b161161e0126e":"$5x + 10 = 15$","3cffefb850b30b5b":"$30x - 100 = 200$","b17c025fc1fca5ef":"$x = 10$","d835003575fd2019":"$9x - 22 = -40$","0ae482c265a0e7fd":"$x = -2$","1482c67a90879fde":"$4x + 18 = 10$","458b2c44db3e9c23":"a) $x = 4$, b) $x = -3$, c) $x = 1$, d) $x = 10$, e) $x = -2$, f) $x = -2$","0a79fe284822d5ad":"Isoler x-leddet først, så del på koeffisienten","252546d9ba5d4c16":"Døme 4","c6d7d946dc847f29":"Løys likningane:\n\na) $8x + 15 = 3x$\n\nb) $4x - 5 = 2x + 11$\n\nc) $-4x = 20$","337353eadb3e5d24":"**Løysing:**\n\na) $8x + 15 = 3x \\quad | - 3x$\n$5x + 15 = 0 \\quad | - 15$\n$5x = -15 \\quad | \\div 5$\n$x = -3$\n\nb) $4x - 5 = 2x + 11 \\quad | - 2x$\n$2x - 5 = 11 \\quad | + 5$\n$2x = 16 \\quad | \\div 2$\n$x = 8$\n\nc) $-4x = 20 \\quad | \\div (-4)$\n$\\frac{-4x}{-4} = \\frac{20}{-4}$\n$x = -5$","0d0b928528513f16":"$10x - 9 = 7x$","e48f8a419112d39e":"$x = 3$","acdfe41ccff691c2":"$4x + 10 = -x$","1d00f47e3ddfc1f8":"$5x + 10 = 4x + 5$","d83617ab7a1c0729":"$x = -5$","7e6fe72ad2925b14":"$-3x = 30$","15a2fe07a44b83a0":"$x = -10$","2cf9e3976f3aee6c":"$-7x = -10 + 3x$","65080380afa5101d":"$-4x + 8 = 2x + 44$","50a348317f5a3c60":"$x = -6$","edf95e811468a72e":"a) $x = 3$, b) $x = -2$, c) $x = -5$, d) $x = -10$, e) $x = 1$, f) $x = -6$","f8611abd7c2ff68d":"Pass på forteikna når du del med negative tal","1f132a17820f95bc":"Døme 5","6cef81e468b5173f":"Løys likningane:\n\na) $\\frac{x}{2} = 5$\n\nb) $\\frac{x}{-3} + 2 = 6$","35cb21e71348f069":"**Løysing:**\n\na) $\\frac{x}{2} = 5 \\quad | \\cdot 2$\n$\\frac{x}{2} \\cdot 2 = 5 \\cdot 2$\n$x = 10$\n\nb) $\\frac{x}{-3} + 2 = 6 \\quad | - 2$\n$\\frac{x}{-3} = 4 \\quad | \\cdot (-3)$\n$x = -12$","8463c19ba32b342e":"$\\frac{x}{3} = 2$","c8c0eaf983df3716":"$x = 6$","0883a5bc7cf207fa":"$\\frac{x}{-5} = -2$