\n$10x = 30 \\quad | \\div 10$\n$x = 3$\n\nb) $\\frac{3}{x + 2} = 2 \\quad | \\cdot (x + 2)$\n$\\frac{3(x + 2)}{x + 2} = 2(x + 2)$\n$3 = 2(x + 2)$\n$3 = 2x + 4$\n$2x + 4 = 3 \\quad | - 4$\n$2x = -1 \\quad | \\div 2$\n$x = -\\frac{1}{2}$","946f5f8b46c9e490":"$\\frac{6}{x} = 2$","e956dba87511791e":"$\\frac{2}{3x} = 2$","59beadcb8b02c5fd":"$x = \\frac{1}{3}$","9f1b59d1e3ffd040":"$\\frac{2}{x} - 2 = 7$","60360f6862f89bd9":"$x = \\frac{2}{9}$","145a393e1bd61df9":"$\\frac{3}{x + 2} = 1$","07147bb9de368504":"$3 = \\frac{-2}{x - 3} + 6$","c410c68777d01f55":"$x = \\frac{11}{3}$","347164c73f441076":"$\\frac{2}{2x - 5} = -2$","09e006d7d8ea7ee0":"a) $x = 3$, b) $x = \\frac{1}{3}$, c) $x = \\frac{2}{9}$, d) $x = 1$, e) $x = \\frac{11}{3}$, f) $x = 2$","d34f9571381ca2c5":"Døme 8","c10737dd93fdc067":"Løys likningane:\n\na) $\\frac{x - 3}{2} = x + 1$\n\nb) $\\frac{3x + 1}{x + 3} = 2$","266eef9e74693290":"**Løysing:**\n\na) $\\frac{x - 3}{2} = x + 1 \\quad | \\cdot 2$\n$x - 3 = 2(x + 1)$\n$x - 3 = 2x + 2 \\quad | + 3$\n$x = 2x + 5 \\quad | - 2x$\n$-x = 5 \\quad | \\cdot (-1)$\n$x = -5$\n\nb) $\\frac{3x + 1}{x + 3} = 2 \\quad | \\cdot (x + 3)$\n$3x + 1 = 2(x + 3)$\n$3x + 1 = 2x + 6 \\quad | - 1$\n$3x = 2x + 5 \\quad | - 2x$\n$x = 5$","9bd8ec70367f9a01":"$\\frac{4x - 6}{3} = x + 3$","5faa258ba91bff2d":"$x = 15$","069916cf272d9aba":"$\\frac{3x}{x + 1} = 2$","22470ccab965f82f":"$\\frac{13x + 2}{2x} = 7$","f135b3e1fcb81678":"$\\frac{x + 1}{4} - 15 = -5$","69a4782945cd1360":"$x = 39$","55e19410693e70bb":"$3 = \\frac{x - 1}{8} + 6$","e1cf9b88a059b333":"$x = -23$","28c772eeb351b948":"$\\frac{3 - x}{x} + 8 = -2$","09f9af8045c99c39":"$x = -\\frac{1}{3}$","87aa98077ad15d50":"a) $x = 15$, b) $x = 2$, c) $x = 2$, d) $x = 39$, e) $x = -23$, f) $x = -\\frac{1}{3}$","7d017e032006228e":"Multipliser båe sider med nemnaren, pass på parentesane","9870b0d886c4f380":"Døme 9","4ac71b22612eb691":"Løys likningane:\n\na) $\\frac{x}{2} + \\frac{2}{3} = 1$\n\nb) $\\frac{2x}{3} - \\frac{2}{5} = 1$","1e869ed806bbba77":"**Løysing:**\n\na) $\\frac{x}{2} + \\frac{2}{3} = 1 \\quad | - \\frac{2}{3}$\n$\\frac{x}{2} = \\frac{3}{3} - \\frac{2}{3}$\n$\\frac{x}{2} = \\frac{1}{3} \\quad | \\cdot 2$\n$x = \\frac{2}{3}$\n\nb) $\\frac{2x}{3} - \\frac{2}{5} = 1 \\quad | + \\frac{2}{5}$\n$\\frac{2x}{3} = \\frac{5}{5} + \\frac{2}{5}$\n$\\frac{2x}{3} = \\frac{7}{5} \\quad | \\cdot 3$\n$2x = \\frac{21}{5} \\quad | \\div 2$\n$x = \\frac{21}{10}$","1a67e6ccfbd705a4":"$\\frac{x}{4} + \\frac{1}{3} = 1$","fb6f28c5f5b92e85":"$x = \\frac{8}{3}$","d9e429c590288178":"$\\frac{2x}{3} - \\frac{2}{2} = 1$","509295b5da738c05":"$\\frac{3x}{2} = \\frac{1}{3}$","39fd59104bd8e7da":"$\\frac{x}{10} + \\frac{3}{2} = \\frac{1}{5}$","c74bfa0132795d18":"$x = -13$","0c95c70f72e2c00b":"$\\frac{3x}{2} = \\frac{1}{5} - 2$","2762ab18a0e6add6":"$x = -\\frac{6}{5}$","2a54277d4be8595b":"$\\frac{1}{4} = \\frac{x}{2} - 3$","3d82ce6ac0c40712":"$x = \\frac{13}{2}$","18a475adc4b42ee3":"a) $x = \\frac{8}{3}$, b) $x = 3$, c) $x = \\frac{2}{9}$, d) $x = -13$, e) $x = -\\frac{6}{5}$, f) $x = \\frac{13}{2}$","2c69f1255f713765":"Finn fellesnemnar eller multipliser med nemnaren","0aaa7b07c144e490":"Døme 10","e4791704ffa1e824":"Løys likninga:\n\n$\\frac{x}{2} + \\frac{x}{3} = 1$","79f621639f8ba965":"**Løysing alternativ 1** (finn fellesnemnar):\n$\\frac{x}{2} + \\frac{x}{3} = 1$\n$\\frac{x \\cdot 3}{2 \\cdot 3} + \\frac{x \\cdot 2}{3 \\cdot 2} = 1$\n$\\frac{3x}{6} + \\frac{2x}{6} = 1$\n$\\frac{3x + 2x}{6} = 1$\n$\\frac{5x}{6} = 1 \\quad | \\cdot 6$\n$5x = 6 \\quad | \\div 5$\n$x = \\frac{6}{5}$\n\n**Løysing alternativ 2** (multipliser med fellesnemnar):\n$\\frac{x}{2} + \\frac{x}{3} = 1 \\quad | \\cdot 6$\n$\\frac{6 \\cdot x}{2} + \\frac{6 \\cdot x}{3} = 1 \\cdot 6$\n$3x + 2x = 6$\n$5x = 6 \\quad | \\div 5$\n$x = \\frac{6}{5}$","2526cba537f99a54":"$\\frac{x}{4} + \\frac{x}{3} = 1$","09cb0a94ff3b512d":"$x = \\frac{12}{7}$","e38f6311c498f6d8":"$\\frac{2x}{3} - \\frac{x}{2} = 1$","3a2251dc2c78a57a":"$\\frac{3x}{2} = \\frac{x}{4}$","25efa207f9f60f58":"$x = 0$","46fd1021c027b46c":"$\\frac{2x}{5} = -\\frac{x}{2} + 10$","db980eec2275e66f":"$x = \\frac{100}{9}$","d8b26474cef44356":"$4 = \\frac{3x}{7} + x$","af4f783dacfba55d":"$x = \\frac{14}{5}$","43df801923853b8e":"$\\frac{x}{2} - \\frac{x}{6} = \\frac{x}{4} - 1$","a87e734325abe92f":"a) $x = \\frac{12}{7}$, b) $x = 6$, c) $x = 0$, d) $x = \\frac{100}{9}$, e) $x = \\frac{14}{5}$, f) $x = -12$","388cce4d35330a28":"Gang alle ledda med fellesnemnar for å fjerne brøkane","e9cf38cdeff35629":"Døme 11","6dbaae6e904a36ba":"Løys likningane:\n\na) $3(x - 2) = 4$\n\nb) $4 - 2(x + 1) = 22$","9df8e5f04a8a21f6":"**Løysing:**\n\na) $3(x - 2) = 4$\n$3x - 6 = 4 \\quad | + 6$\n$3x = 10 \\quad | \\div 3$\n$x = \\frac{10}{3}$\n\nb) $4 - 2(x + 1) = 22 \\quad | - 4$\n$-2(x + 1) = 18$\n$-2x - 2 = 18 \\quad | + 2$\n$-2x = 20 \\quad | \\div (-2)$\n$x = -10$","c7d9ab6db6512843":"$2(x - 1) = 4$","b7598a7bd7924dd9":"$5(x - 2) = 3$","3370b035a0314446":"$x = \\frac{13}{5}$","d80cea7a5e40334a":"$2 + 3(x - 1) = 5$","8b80039ef490bff0":"$5(x + 1) = 2(x - 1)$","c8a29f73a8d8e571":"$x = -\\frac{7}{3}$","60e73634f7896860":"$6 - 3(x + 2) = x$","a7a1187dabdd37a1":"$-2(3x - 15) = 8x - (-x)$","4ab915eab172243b":"a) $x = 3$, b) $x = \\frac{13}{5}$, c) $x = 2$, d) $x = -\\frac{7}{3}$, e) $x = 0$, f) $x = 2$","9b13095014c3f48e":"Multipliser ut parentesane først","4aeeb2124c397f5c":"Døme 12","88db0e9af699c573":"Løys likningane:\n\na) $\\frac{1}{2} - \\frac{2x - 4}{2} = 5$\n\nb) $\\frac{2x}{x + 1} - \\frac{3}{2} = 2$","711a37eb6ba6d686":"**Løysing:**\n\na) $\\frac{1}{2} - \\frac{2x - 4}{2} = 5 \\quad | \\cdot 2$\n$1 - (2x - 4) = 10$\n$1 - 2x + 4 = 10 \\quad | - 1 - 4$\n$-2x = 5 \\quad | \\div (-2)$\n$x = -\\frac{5}{2}$\n\nb) Vi ser at fellesnemnar blir $2(x + 1)$. Gang med dette på begge sider:\n$\\frac{2x}{x + 1} - \\frac{3}{2} = 2$\n$\\frac{2 \\cdot 2x}{2(x + 1)} - \\frac{3(x + 1)}{2(x + 1)} = 2$\n$\\frac{4x - 3(x + 1)}{2(x + 1)} = 2$\n$\\frac{4x - 3x - 3}{2(x + 1)} = 2$\n$\\frac{x - 3}{2x + 2} = 2 \\quad | \\cdot (2x + 2)$\n$x - 3 = 4x + 4 \\quad | - 4x + 3$\n$-3x = 7 \\quad | \\div (-3)$\n$x = -\\frac{7}{3}$","9db9acbfff543cfd":"$\\frac{1}{2} - \\frac{x + 1}{2} = 4$","5ee841e8a1e90e59":"$\\frac{1}{3} - \\frac{x - 2}{2} = 2$","7a309f46fd8fabca":"$x = -\\frac{4}{3}$","bb444900b995429b":"$\\frac{x}{x + 2} - \\frac{1}{2} = 1$","b7be531c86383523":"$\\frac{2x - 1}{x + 5} = -\\frac{3}{2}$","0f8ab709a927d77d":"$x = -\\frac{13}{7}$","77f18f2f6aaad19d":"$\\frac{5x - 1}{2x + 1} + \\frac{1}{2} = -\\frac{5}{2}$","445beb090503fa81":"$x = -\\frac{2}{11}$","4b42529f4acf4afe":"$\\frac{5x - 1}{-x + 1} = \\frac{1}{2} - \\frac{5}{3}$","89e4de9cc4c51498":"$x = -\\frac{1}{23}$","f551742bde5d1451":"a) $x = -8$, b) $x = -\\frac{4}{3}$, c) $x = -6$, d) $x = -\\frac{13}{7}$, e) $x = -\\frac{2}{11}$, f) $x = -\\frac{1}{23}$","aa4272203898a318":"Finn fellesnevnar, gang og pass på forteikn i parentesar","f3cfc8435bc180ac":"Døme 13","0836c92ab73834f8":"Løys likninga:\n\n$\\frac{3}{4}\\left(\\frac{1}{3} - x\\right) + 2x = 5$","80ce93c4a47b72ee":"**Løysing:**\n$\\frac{3}{4}\\left(\\frac{1}{3} - x\\right) + 2x = 5$\n$\\frac{3}{4} \\cdot \\frac{1}{3} - \\frac{3}{4} \\cdot x + 2x = 5$\n$\\frac{1}{4} - \\frac{3x}{4} + 2x = 5 \\quad | \\cdot 4$\n$1 - 3x + 8x = 20 \\quad | - 1$\n$5x = 19 \\quad | \\div 5$\n$x = \\frac{19}{5}$","f441755c7e69e151":"$\\frac{1}{2}(1 - x) = 5$","bffb8f5baca5f8db":"$x = -9$","804e05d4848f6969":"$\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\frac{x}{3} - 1\\right) = 1$","26ff9c39f852ead7":"$\\frac{3}{5}\\left(5 - \\frac{x}{3}\\right) + 2x = 2$","215d5458594f3455":"$x = -\\frac{5}{9}$","13ecf9fe8c22cd9c":"$\\frac{3}{7}\\left(x - \\frac{1}{2}\\right) = 5 - x$","bab6b86d5be73b3e":"$x = \\frac{73}{20}$","0bd5010b1170d833":"$\\frac{5x}{4}\\left(\\frac{1}{3} - \\frac{1}{2}\\right) = \\frac{x}{2} - 1$","b5649b30d0c41675":"$x = \\frac{24}{17}$","6bfab19588815946":"$\\frac{x}{4} - 1 = x\\left(\\frac{1}{3} - 2\\right)$","3de98080a38d9209":"$x = \\frac{12}{23}$","56a527c03cfd3dba":"a) $x = -9$, b) $x = 15$, c) $x = -\\frac{5}{9}$, d) $x = \\frac{73}{20}$, e) $x = \\frac{24}{17}$, f) $x = \\frac{12}{23}$","6c3f5e737e1a8eac":"Multipliser ut parentesane, samla alle x-ledd og konstantar","561bbe0cda91581c":"## Oppsummering\n\n- **Løyse likningar:** Gjer same operasjon på begge sider av likheitsteiknet for å isolera $x$\n- **Addisjon/subtraksjon:** $x + a = b \\Rightarrow x = b - a$\n- **Multiplikasjon/divisjon:** $ax = b \\Rightarrow x = \\frac{b}{a}$\n- **Brøklikningar:** $\\frac{x}{a} = b \\Rightarrow x = ab$ (gang begge sider med nemnaren)\n- **Likningar med brøkar:** $\\frac{a}{x} = b \\Rightarrow a = bx \\Rightarrow x = \\frac{a}{b}$\n- **Fleire brøkar:** Finn fellesnevnar og gang heile likninga med denne\n- **Parentesar:** Multipliser ut før du løyser likninga\n- Hugs å kontrollera svaret ved å setja det inn i den opphavlege likninga"}}}